# Discharge Patient Flow

## 0. Overview

This file is the direct Discharge flow source of truth for HOSSPI HMS. Discharge orchestrates **multi-step inpatient clearance** on the **IPD admission / encounter** â" it does not create parallel records. Align with [`.cursor/flows/ipd-flow.mdc`](./ipd-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/opd-flow.mdc`](./opd-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/nursing-flow.mdc`](./nursing-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/pharmacy-flow.mdc`](./pharmacy-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/icu-flow.mdc`](./icu-flow.mdc), and [`.cursor/app-write-up.mdc`](../app-write-up.mdc).

## 1. Goal

Enable doctors, nurses, pharmacists, billers, and discharge coordinators to complete discharge planning, pending-order review, multi-party clearance, patient exit, bed release handoff, and encounter closure â" without conflating OPD visit completion with IPD discharge.

### Central encounter rule

All clearance attaches to the **IPD admission**. OPD `DISCHARGED` ([opd-flow Â§3](./opd-flow.mdc)) completes the **outpatient visit only** â" handled in OPD flow, not this module.

