## 3. Step-by-Step Discharge Workflow

| Step | What Happens | Main Role | API / pattern |
| ---- | ------------ | --------- | ------------- |
| 1 | Doctor marks discharge planned | Doctor | `POST /ipd-flows/:id/plan-discharge` |
| 2 | System checks pending lab, radiology, procedure, medication, consult, nursing tasks | System | Read from encounter |
| 3 | Doctor confirms ignorable vs required pending items | Doctor | Discharge UI |
| 4 | Discharge summary, advice, follow-up prepared | Doctor | Summary API / IPD notes |
| 5 | Take-home medicines prepared | Pharmacy | [pharmacy-flow](./pharmacy-flow.mdc) |
| 6 | Final bill, balance, insurance closure | Billing | Billing workspace link |
| 7 | Nursing clearance and patient education | Nurse | [nursing-flow](./nursing-flow.mdc) |
| 8 | Patient exits; documents provided | Discharge desk | |
| 9 | Bed released for cleaning | Bed manager / System | `release-bed`; Housekeeping handoff |
| 10 | IPD encounter closed | System | `POST /ipd-flows/:id/finalize-discharge` |

