## 4. Discharge Status Mapping

Map UI to [ipd-flow Â§12](./ipd-flow.mdc) recommended statuses:

| Status | Meaning |
| ------ | ------- |
| `Not Started` | No discharge plan |
| `Planned` | `DISCHARGE_PLANNED` stage |
| `Summary Pending` | Doctor summary incomplete |
| `Medication Pending` | Take-home meds not ready |
| `Billing Pending` | Financial clearance incomplete |
| `Nursing Clearance Pending` | Ward checklist incomplete |
| `Documents Ready` | All clearances complete |
| `Patient Exited` | Physical exit recorded |
| `Completed` | `DISCHARGED` / encounter closed |

**Rule:** Do not show âpatient dischargedâ until IPD `DISCHARGED` stage ([icu-flow Â§12](./icu-flow.mdc) same rule).

